- `weft-core`: added `VerifyIssue` enum + `verify_requirement()`, checking id format (`REQ-NNN`), id/filename match, non-empty acceptance, and stored-vs-derived hash integrity (with a "run `weft bump REQ-xxx`" message on drift).
